repository-code: "https://github.com/tideswellgroup/multilingual-classics-markdown"
url: "https://github.com/tideswellgroup/multilingual-classics-markdown"
abstract: >-
  A curated public-domain literary corpus in 54 languages across 67 locales,
  converted to clean markdown with YAML frontmatter. Spans 14 language
  families and 20 script systems including Latin (with rich diacritics),
  Cyrillic, Greek, Hebrew, Arabic, Perso-Arabic, Devanagari, Bengali,
  Gurmukhi, Gujarati, Odia, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Tibetan, Egyptian hieroglyphs, CJK (Han,
  kana, Hangul), Thai abugida, Cherokee syllabary, plus three
  constructed auxiliary languages. Designed as a drop-in test corpus
  for application developers, NLP researchers, language learners, and
  typography enthusiasts working with multilingual content.
